      "id": 1,
      "text": "Burke, Texas was founded in 1881‑82 at the northernmost point of the Houston, East and West Texas Railway, on what was then called Bradley Prairie.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
